{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to survive among vicious monster insects and save your nest? In Hell Bug Demo, you will be able to play in rainforest biome levels. There is only one boss, The Rhino, if you can beat him for the first time, you will unlock a new character with different ability, it's name is also Rhino, all the playable characters in Hell Bug are smaller versions of the bosses so you can enjoy different abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to unlock all the guns, keep fighting with the Rhino Boss, after the first time you defeat it, a special firefly money will drop. Use it to unlock\u00a0 guns in base with the marketeer bug, trade fireflies with guns, they will be unlocked and will be found in chests in game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the demo loop as long as you want; more biomes, levels, guns, bosses and characters will come in full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/extras/47b48fa5122d7d27253b94445b4fc862.poster.avif?t=1758216049\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/extras/47b48fa5122d7d27253b94445b4fc862.webm?t=1758216049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/extras/47b48fa5122d7d27253b94445b4fc862.mp4?t=1758216049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015550?t=1758216049","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015550?t=1758216049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/cbde096c622e515ca913215e3910c6956b1308b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758216049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/cbde096c622e515ca913215e3910c6956b1308b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758216049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to survive among vicious monster insects and save your nest? In Hell Bug Demo, you will be able to play in rainforest biome levels. There is only one boss, The Rhino, if you can beat him for the first time, you will unlock a new character with different ability, it's name is also Rhino, all the playable characters in Hell Bug are smaller versions of the bosses so you can enjoy different abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to unlock all the guns, keep fighting with the Rhino Boss, after the first time you defeat it, a special firefly money will drop. Use it to unlock\u00a0 guns in base with the marketeer bug, trade fireflies with guns, they will be unlocked and will be found in chests in game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the demo loop as long as you want; more biomes, levels, guns, bosses and characters will come in full version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/extras/47b48fa5122d7d27253b94445b4fc862.poster.avif?t=1758216049\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/extras/47b48fa5122d7d27253b94445b4fc862.webm?t=1758216049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015550/extras/47b48fa5122d7d27253b94445b4fc862.mp4?t=1758216049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Limonit Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3400470","name":"Hell Bug"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descripti